   "definition_quote": "There exists an arm $a^\\star\\in[N]$ with $p_{a^\\star,j}>\\tfrac{1}{2}$ for every $j\\neq a^\\star$, and $\\Delta \\coloneqq \\min_{i\\neq j}|p_{i,j}-\\tfrac{1}{2}| > 0.$ ... In the fixed-confidence BAI problem, the learner receives a confidence parameter $\\delta\\in(0,1)$, stops at a data-dependent time $\\tau$, and outputs an arm $\\widehat a$."
